                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                  <p>Celebrated as ‘Young Icon of the Decade’, ‘Best Citizen of India’, ‘Face of  21st Century Architecture in India’, and featured in ‘Who’s Who of Asia,’ he is leading one of the world’s largest architecture and urban design firms. His philanthropic spirit as the ideator for CP Kukreja Foundation &amp; work in advocating for sustainability are indispensable to Aparajita as a force for good.</p>
