<div class="modal fade" id="THANGAMMAL" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog  modal-dialog-centered modal-lg" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">                
                <h5 class="modal-title" id="exampleModalLabel">THANGAMMAL</h5>
               <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">X</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
              <p>For Thangammal, समर्पण is muscle memory. At 80, she still free-dives off Pamban Island in Tamil Nadu, sari-clad, holding her breath for minutes to harvest seaweed that sustains her family. She follows a 12-day lunar cycle to protect marine life and rotates across 21 islands to ease pressure on reefs.
Keeper of generational knowledge, she mentors younger women in diving, sales, and survival, while joining women-led groups to share boats and risks in protected waters. With cloth-wrapped fingers, T-shirts over saris, and rubber slippers, she makes this hard work a little safer.
Her life is a story of समर्पण &#8211; to her community, her sisterhood, and the sea.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
