                        <div class="row sec-pad">
                            <div class="col-sm-12">
                                <p class="mb-4">For the first time in Kolkata, Sanmarg Aparajita lit up the legendary Stephen Court at Park Street and the historic Greek Orthodox Church at Kalighat in “RED.” Our effort to do something iconic to mark the strength in every woman.</p>
                                <p class="mb-4">Aparajita went viral earlier this year–our initiative towards saluting womanhood gained massive traction online, all for a good cause! For the FIRST TIME in Kolkata, Sanmarg Aparajita lit up the legendary Stephen Court and historic Greek Orthodox Church in “RED,” ahead of the Aparajita main ceremony event. Our effort to do something iconic to mark the strength in every woman, that received so much love. An initiative by Sanmarg Hindi Daily.</p>
