                            <div class="modal-content">
                                <div class="modal-header">                
                                    <h5 class="modal-title" id="exampleModalLabel">Mina Pandit</h5>
                                   <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">X</button>
                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                  <p>Even the pandemic couldn&#8217;t stop this third-generation street food specialist, the winner of the Popular Award in Gourmet for 2024. She believes in self-sufficiency and hard work, passing on her skills to her 4 daughters, catering to prominent clients such as Rekha and Kapil Dev besides garnering extensive media coverage and the love of Kolkata&#8217;s community street food lovers!</p>
                                </div>
