                                   <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">X</button>
                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                  <p>The force from Siliguri fighting against human trafficking &#8211; founder of Kanchanjungha Uddhar Kendra, Rangu Souriya, won the Popular Award for Community Service &#038; Advocacy in 2024!</p>
                    <p>She founded her NGO in 2004 with her own savings &#038; small donations from well-wishers at a time when the closures of tea gardens were causing spikes in the trafficking of women &#038; children. Her work has earned her numerous honours from both government and non-government organisations.</p>
