                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                  <p>A recipient of honours like the Stree Shakti Award &#038; the National Award for Young Woman Bioscientist, Smt. Anuradha has gained unparalleled experience as a visiting scientist in several countries. As a woman in STEM herself, she champions the adoption of STEM amongst women &#038; is a passionate supporter of promoting classical dance forms.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal fade" id="dolly" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
