                                   <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">X</button>
                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                  <p>So many tears shed, so many hearts full. Dolly Jain &#8211; a true “parampara ki parchai.”</p>
                                  <p>Gracing the Sanmarg Aparajita stage not for the first time, but as Aparajita’s FIRST EVER undeclared Jury Awardee… And the surprises kept coming because Ruchika Gupta and the Sanmarg Aparajita team worked very hard to secretly bring Dolly’s daughter Aanya over from Bangalore. Her heartfelt words made it all worth it.</p>
                    <p>This one was an ode to the Calcutta girl in her. To the fighter in her. To the Aparajita in her.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal fade" id="pawan" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
                        <div class="modal-dialog  modal-dialog-centered modal-lg" role="document">
                            <div class="modal-content">
                                <div class="modal-header">                
                                    <h5 class="modal-title" id="exampleModalLabel">Pawan Kumar Dhoot</h5>
                                   <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">X</button>
                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                  <p>His support has blessed Aparajita’s every edition! Our title sponsor. Under his guidance, Dhoot Group has grown into a pan-national conglomerate with interests as varied as real estate and aviation. His work to impactfully, empathetically &#038; structurally improve healthcare &#038; education for the underprivileged, combined with his soulful guidance as the driving force for Aparajita in her 13 editions &#8211; are both truly incomparable and deeply treasured.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal fade" id="dik" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
                        <div class="modal-dialog  modal-dialog-centered modal-lg" role="document">
                            <div class="modal-content">
                                <div class="modal-header">                
                                    <h5 class="modal-title" id="exampleModalLabel">Dikshu Kukreja</h5>
                                   <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">X</button>
                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                  <p>Celebrated as ‘Young Icon of the Decade’, ‘Best Citizen of India’, ‘Face of  21st Century Architecture in India’, and featured in ‘Who’s Who of Asia,’ he is leading one of the world’s largest architecture and urban design firms. His philanthropic spirit as the ideator for CP Kukreja Foundation &#038; work in advocating for sustainability are indispensable to Aparajita as a force for good.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal fade" id="madhuD" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
                        <div class="modal-dialog  modal-dialog-centered modal-lg" role="document">
                            <div class="modal-content">
                                <div class="modal-header">                
                                    <h5 class="modal-title" id="exampleModalLabel">Madhu Dugar</h5>
                                   <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">X</button>
                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                  <p>She is a part of several educational, social, cultural, spiritual, and philanthropic associations. She is a big advocate for positive societal change, philanthrophy, and women’s rights. She actively champions the celebration of women, magnifying not only their triumphs but also shedding light on the formidable challenges they courageously confront. Her belief in ensuring every woman’s voice is heard, and stories are told is critical to Aparajita.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
