                                    <h5 class="modal-title" id="exampleModalLabel">Sunil Kumar</h5>
                                   <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary">X</button>
                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                  <p>With 20+ years of experience in the luxury hospitality space, he is now the General Manager at JW Marriott Hotel Kolkata. His business acumen and leadership skills are hailed across the board and continue to inspire Aparajita&#8217;s eye for detail &#038; sense of service.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
