                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                  <p>As an alumna of the prestigious Harvard Business School with many achievements under her belt, she is a woman trailblazer in commerce &#038; industry, also serving as an Independent Director of Greenply Industries Ltd. and is the Director of Continental Valves Ltd. A 2018 Aparajita honoree &#038; the voice of women leaders across chambers of commerce, she supports Aparajita&#8217;s processes &#038; functions throughout the year.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal fade" id="advisory" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
                        <div class="modal-dialog  modal-dialog-centered modal-lg" role="document">
                            <div class="modal-content">
