 Ms. Nundy has lead a number of constitutional cases including the case to criminalise marital rape, on free speech overbroad criminal provisions that quell speech as well as on tech regulatiom. She has also worked on the &#8220;anti rape&#8221; laws of 2013, and advised the United Nations and the governments of a number of countries on women&#8217;s rights.<br><br> 
