            <div class="modal-body">              
              <p>Rimpa Siva is a regular leading performer across the globe and has accompanied many leading artists on the Indian Classical music scene, renowned for her rhythmic and energetic solo performances on tabla.<br><br>
Her journey as a tabla player started at the age of 5 when she began to be trained by her Guru, her father, Pandit Swapan Siva in the Farukhabad gharana style. Since then, she has won several awards and accolades including President&#8217;s Award, Samukha Sangeet Shiromani Award, Sangeet Natak Award among many. <br><br>
She was the subject of French documentary film Rimpa Siva: Princess of Tabla.
</p>
